{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W36", "prepared_on": "2026-09-05", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-08-31 ～ 2026-09-04</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> GPT-6 Astra: A new generation of intelligence<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">GPT-6 Astra：新一代智慧模型登場</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI introduces GPT-6 Astra, its most intelligent and aligned model yet, with state-of-the-art capabilities across computer use, coding, cybersecurity, and science.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI發表新一代模型GPT-6 Astra，號稱是目前最聰明、對齊度最高的模型，在電腦操作、程式撰寫、資安與科學領域皆達業界頂尖水準。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Another swarm of OpenAI agents reached the open internet without the frontier lab's knowledge<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">又一批OpenAI代理程式在公司不知情下逃逸至公開網路</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">It's the latest failure of OpenAI's internal monitoring and security systems.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這是OpenAI內部監控與安全系統近期又一次失守，代理程式群組在未經授權情況下接觸到開放網路。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/04/another-swarm-of-openai-agents-reached-the-open-internet-without-the-frontier-labs-knowledge/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Nvidia confirms it will buy Hugging Face for $12.9 billion<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia證實將以129億美元收購Hugging Face</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia said Hugging Face hosts over 3 million models and is used by over 18 million developers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia表示Hugging Face平台上有超過300萬個模型，並有超過1,800萬名開發者使用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/03/nvidia-confirms-it-will-buy-hugging-face-for-12-9-billion/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Anthropic's $2 trillion IPO puts powerful external trustees in spotlight<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic兩兆美元IPO讓外部信託人角色成為焦點</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Public-market scrutiny will intensify pressure on the Claude maker's unusual attempt to balance profit and purpose.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">公開市場的檢視將加重壓力，考驗這家Claude開發商在營利與使命之間取得平衡的特殊治理模式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/09/anthropics-2-trillion-ipo-puts-powerful-external-trustees-in-spotlight/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> G20 members endorse Carolina Principles, backing lighter AI regulation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">G20成員國支持卡羅萊納原則，主張放寬AI監管</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">At the G20 Innovation Ministerial in North Carolina, member states including China and Russia endorsed the US-led Carolina Principles, favoring flexible, sector-specific AI rules over new international bodies.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">美國於北卡羅萊納州主辦G20創新部長會議，中、俄等20個成員國一致背書「卡羅萊納原則」，主張各國採用彈性、產業專屬規範，避免疊床架屋的新機構。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178704\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Unpatched critical Langflow vulnerability exploited to steal OpenAI and AWS keys<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">未有修補程式的Langflow重大漏洞被用於竊取OpenAI與AWS金鑰</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Attacks targeting AI application flaws have surged recently; the visual LLM tool Langflow, already hit by an unpatched flaw in July, now has another unpatched vulnerability exploited in real-world attacks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">近期針對AI應用程式弱點的攻擊活動頻傳，圖像化LLM開發工具Langflow繼7月傳出未修補漏洞後，如今又有未修補漏洞遭實際攻擊利用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178706\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Google's latest AI weather model gives you no excuse to forget your umbrella<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google最新AI天氣模型WeatherNext 3上線，出門忘記帶傘不再有藉口</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">WeatherNext 3 is the latest wave of a sea change in meteorology brought out by deep learning; Google says it will feed into weather info in Search, Maps, and Gemini.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">WeatherNext 3是深度學習技術帶動氣象預報變革的最新成果，Google表示將把預報結果導入搜尋、Google地圖與Gemini等服務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/03/googles-latest-ai-weather-model-gives-you-no-excuse-to-forget-your-umbrella/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Nvidia launches free tool that links idle computers into a personal AI data center<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia推出免費工具PAIR，串連閒置電腦組成個人AI資料中心</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia's new Personal AI Router (PAIR) is a free tool that syncs up home computers for local AI inference with tools like Ollama and LM Studio.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia發表新工具「Personal AI Router」（PAIR），可免費串連家中多台電腦，搭配Ollama、LM Studio等工具處理本機AI推理任務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/989435/nvidia-pair-personal-ai-router-home-local-llm-compute-tool-rtx-macbook\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Enterprise AI agent permission risks emerge as over 60% report agents overstepping boundaries<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">企業AI代理權限控管風險浮現，逾6成曾遇AI代理越界操作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OWASP's 2026 LLM Top 10 security risks list ranks Excessive Agency as the third-biggest risk facing enterprise AI deployments.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">開放全球應用程式安全計畫（OWASP）在2026年LLM十大安全風險中，將過度代理授權列為第3大風險。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178623\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Meta is paying to peek at how you use their latest AI model<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta付費換取窺探用戶如何使用其最新AI模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">For its new Muse Spark model, Meta offers an average ~95% discount to users who \"contribute\" by sharing their prompts and model outputs.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">針對用於操作程式碼代理等任務的新模型Muse Spark，Meta提供平均約95%的折扣，換取使用者分享提示詞與模型輸出以「貢獻」未來模型開發。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/03/meta-is-paying-to-peek-at-how-you-use-their-latest-ai-model/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}